Build provenance:
  - Source: openssl-3.5.9 (upstream release tarball, unmodified)
  - Target: x86_64 (HarmonyOS simulator, musl)
  - Toolchain: HarmonyOS command-line-tools, NDK clang 15.0.4
    (llvm/bin/x86_64-unknown-linux-ohos-clang, 内置 OHOS musl sysroot)
  - Configure: ./Configure linux-x86_64-clang
      CC=$NDK/llvm/bin/x86_64-unknown-linux-ohos-clang
      CXX=$NDK/llvm/bin/x86_64-unknown-linux-ohos-clang++
      AR=$NDK/llvm/bin/llvm-ar RANLIB=$NDK/llvm/bin/llvm-ranlib
      no-shared no-tests no-legacy no-quic no-dtls no-ocsp no-ct no-ts
      no-srp no-psk no-sm2 no-sm3 no-sm4 no-rc2 no-md4 no-tls1 no-tls1_1
      no-engine no-async no-sock no-deprecated --prefix=<install>
    （缩减构建与 ../openssl 同口径：保留 TLS1.2/1.3 客户端所需全部能力，
    移除 atls 未使用的 legacy 提供者/QUIC/DTLS/OCSP/SM 族等）
  - Note: 上游 3.5.9 无 ohos 目标，且 3.5.x 的 Configure 中 -DCC 只进
    预处理 flag，Makefile 工具须用裸 `CC=...` make 变量形式传入。
  - Artifacts: lib/libcrypto.a, lib/libssl.a (static, no shared libraries)
  - Headers: include/openssl/ (verbatim from the install tree)

